{
    "background_story": "Zaylee, a free-spirited artist, had always dreamed of a romantic getaway. She met her soulmate, Max, at an art gallery opening, and their whirlwind romance left them both breathless. As they strolled along the moonlit beach, Max turned to Zaylee and proposed a spontaneous elopement. Without hesitation, Zaylee agreed, and they made their way to a quaint little chapel in the nearby town. With only the stars as witnesses, they exchanged vows in an intimate ceremony, promising to love and cherish each other. After a romantic honeymoon in a secluded bed and breakfast, they returned home to share the news with their friends and family. Zaylee's elopement was a testament to her adventurous spirit and her willingness to follow her heart, no matter where it may lead.",
